's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"514d5dfe05c98a2dcfd485d50cd09d6c","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"9dea2aebed539c791ca97b9ed554584a","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c8d5642dff66bc3edba042cc2403f0fd","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"96e289bb0eecf52d71c3262d5177da43","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"bcc451aaf6de7e0eb19fffe4682ad156","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"fe42aa58985844fa01af1b6aaf204c70","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"dde716abbb71bd04fe9e4e0205af6fce","originalFileName":"6c7702ca-5692-48db-8a04-0d4275a1889a-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"8887d665